ntertops, stainless steel appliances, and a desirable gas range-combining timeless style with everyday functionality. The spacious bedroom offers a relaxing retreat with generous closet space, while the beautifully remodeled bathroom features an updated vanity and a sleek glass-enclosed tiled shower with tub. Just beyond the main living area, a versatile flex room provides the perfect space for a home office, reading nook, hobby room, fitness area, or additional sitting room to suit your lifestyle. Beyond the flex space, the enclosed sunroom is surrounded by expansive windows that overlook the lush, manicured grounds, creating a peaceful setting to enjoy your morning coffee, unwind with a good book, or simply relax while taking in the tranquil views, with direct access to the outdoor green space. Residents of Orchid Springs Village enjoy a carefree lifestyle with exceptional community amenities, including a sparkling swimming pool, clubhouse, scenic walking paths, convenient laundry facilities, assigned covered carport parking, and beautifully maintained landscaping. Perfectly positioned in the heart of Winter Haven, this move-in-ready condo is just minutes from Winter Haven Hospital, shopping centers, local restaurants, golf courses, and the vibrant downtown district. Outdoor enthusiasts will appreciate the proximity to Lake Shipp Park and Lake Hartridge Nature Park, while the world-famous LEGOLAND(R) Florida Resort and Winter Haven's renowned Chain of Lakes are just a short drive away. With easy access to US-27 and the Polk Parkway, commuting to Orlando, Tampa, and surrounding Central Florida destinations is effortless.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1400,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/a8a1ff246838afac841f4aad3843282fl-m570579908r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["house_view","back_side","complete"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/a8a1ff246838afac841f4